{"version":1,"key":"card:750","content":{"id":750,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e93f56d4-98e5-4545-9e5d-e2ce2f1cd7d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当用户点击页面内的锚点链接或「返回顶部」按钮时，浏览器默认会瞬间跳转到目标位置，体验上比较生硬。CSS 提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll-behavior"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来解决这个问题，只需要一行声明就能让页面滚动变得平滑。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3acfbbfb-8114-48f7-abeb-195ae7289dc0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的取值很简单："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"376766fd-2de8-432f-a07c-e4064bf44fa2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3f177771-2ea7-4222-abc9-c34404ba13f2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49fdafa7-a343-4f14-8c71-a1701a995d96","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"auto"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：浏览器的默认行为，瞬间滚动完成"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7633ba52-113e-40f2-9950-cf781d9b99fa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9aaedd1e-2328-4134-bc12-df274877733f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"smooth"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：平滑滚动"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"05939105-aec4-4770-a3eb-38684c1ee425","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常见的用法是直接设置在 html 元素上，这样页面中所有通过锚点触发的滚动都会变得平滑："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"9c0d2f11-7297-41cc-bb39-d62e1171e5df","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c78d691e-d106-4ee2-8c72-cda06aabe93e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"html {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}","collabId":"09c8be29-245c-46f0-a113-d7b152b7cb43","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8fba752b-0892-4a2d-a3a5-cc31e65d25b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如页面中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<a href=\"#top\">返回顶部</a>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的锚点链接，配合上面的声明，点击后就会平滑地滚回页面顶部，而不是生硬地跳转。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d1a275d-d251-49f6-99fd-65488f667423","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过需要注意的是，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll-behavior"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不支持自定义滚动时长和缓动函数，浏览器会按自己的默认节奏完成动画。另外它只影响导航或程序脚本触发的滚动，不会干扰用户通过鼠标滚轮、触摸板等人为操作产生的滚动。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"859aab0a-a5ea-42c2-bf71-c14481d12ed5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 JavaScript 中也有一些可以触发滚动的函数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"5b2139a3-8a9b-474c-aff3-062829361acd","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"31e63065-8455-4d0a-a669-777393700fa2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0d29543-3ae9-4650-9f64-d4d67f1879b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window.scrollTo"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4ea9663b-3f85-45ce-bc6c-18c8846395e5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"793c906a-e839-4c41-96cf-21494cc80478","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window.scrollBy"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d1bf3278-4b53-4736-8bae-c11ce46f05f5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0262e48b-1049-4bae-9b64-8b4a2a23a51c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"element.scrollTo"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ff2d90be-32f2-4293-a188-8c6ea7913380","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3295d54b-c5fc-4000-b357-2f4e0eb139fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"element.scrollBy"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d2d2bcbf-307b-48a2-97df-c1489e672c1e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf558968-f5a2-4121-8d80-950610e4246f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"element.scrollIntoView"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b118cf82-674b-4c13-984c-9fbc98a296b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些函数可以和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll-behavior"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 配合实现平滑滚动，不过它们自身也接受 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"behavior"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数来配置滚动行为。建议在调用时显式设置，代码意图更清晰，也更容易维护："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8876b143-9aca-43e1-9326-ea6f0d200298","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b06b6582-1298-4d24-a4a0-160217dcc541","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"element.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"start\", inline: \"nearest\" });","collabId":"e5201df0-2c20-438b-8ecb-fa892e98a4c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["CSS/scroll-behavior"],"createTime":1780375731433,"updateTime":1780376560883,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1780376560883}}